<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Steam 史低 · 当日新增</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="static/app.css?v={{ assets_version }}">
</head>
<body>

<header class="topbar">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Steam 史低 · 当日新增</h1>
    <div class="generated">生成时间：{{ generated_at_text }}</div>
  </div>
</header>

<div id="stale-banner" class="stale-banner" hidden>
  数据已超过 {{ stale_banner_hours }} 小时未更新，可能抓取任务出了问题。
</div>

<main class="wrap">
  <!-- 批 F：概览改成多个独立小框，窄屏自动换行铺满整行 ——
       比原来的「左大框 + 右 40% 筛选条件框」在手机上更好读（不再挤成一条）。
       筛选条件框已删除，判定口径全部写进 README「筛选条件」一节 -->
  <section class="overview">
    <div class="stat-box">
      <div class="stat-label">今日新增 Steam 史低</div>
      <div class="stat-value">{{ overview.new_today_shown }}<span class="stat-unit">款</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-box">
      <div class="stat-label">当日新增</div>
      <div class="stat-value">{{ overview.new_today_raw }}<span class="stat-unit">款</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-box">
      <div class="stat-label">未进列表</div>
      <div class="stat-value">{{ overview.new_today_raw - overview.new_today_shown }}<span class="stat-unit">款</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-box">
      <div class="stat-label">新史低</div>
      <div class="stat-value stat-new">{{ low_points["new"] }}<span class="stat-unit">款</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-box">
      <div class="stat-label">平史低</div>
      <div class="stat-value stat-tie">{{ low_points["tie"] }}<span class="stat-unit">款</span></div>
    </div>
    {% if low_points["unknown"] %}
    <div class="stat-box">
      <div class="stat-label">史低待确认</div>
      <div class="stat-value stat-unknown">{{ low_points["unknown"] }}<span class="stat-unit">款</span></div>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
  </section>

  <nav class="filters" id="filters">
    {% for view in views %}
    <button type="button"
            class="filter{% if view.enabled %} active{% endif %}"
            data-view="{{ view.key }}"
            {% if not view.enabled %}disabled title="数据攒够后再开"{% endif %}>
      {{ view.label }}{% if view.enabled %} ({{ view.count }}){% endif %}
    </button>
    {% endfor %}
    <label class="toggle">
      <input type="checkbox" id="no-image"> 无图精简模式
    </label>
  </nav>

  <p class="notice">{{ notice }}</p>

  <div id="list" class="list"></div>

  <p id="empty" class="empty" hidden>今天没有符合条件的史低新增。</p>
</main>

<footer class="wrap footer">
  <p>
    数据来源：IsThereAnyDeal / Steam ·
    抓取口径：{{ overview.sweep }} ·
    详情：本轮抓 {{ overview.detail_fetched }} 条{% if overview.detail_backlog is not none %}，目录还差 {{ overview.detail_backlog }} 条{% endif %} ·
    状态库最近一次运行：{{ overview.last_run_at or '—' }}
  </p>
  <p>
    本轮抓取 {{ overview.deals_fetched }} 条折扣 · 其中史低 {{ overview.hist_low_total }} 条
  </p>
  {% if fx %}
  <p>
    汇率取数日期 {{ fx.date }}（基准 {{ fx.base }}）：{% for r in fx.rates %}1 {{ fx.base }} = {{ r.rate }} {{ r.code }}{% if not loop.last %} · {% endif %}{% endfor %}
  </p>
  {% endif %}
  <p>价格与好评率仅供参考；区域价格仅供比价，以 Steam 实际结算为准，且不代表可购买。</p>
</footer>

<script src="data.js?v={{ assets_version }}"></script>
<script src="static/app.js?v={{ assets_version }}"></script>
</body>
</html>